## ⚙️ DevOps, Deployments & Maintenance Scripts

One of the most notable features of this repository is its extensive array of deployment scripts and developer-focused databases management utilities:

*   **Reverse Proxy Configs**: Several custom Nginx configurations (`teqmates_nginx.conf`, `client_zeebull_nginx.conf`, `nginx_teqmates.conf`) mapping landing pages to `https://domain/`, admin dashboard to `/admin`, and the reservation API to `/resort`.
*   **Linux Systemd Services**: Confirms enterprise setups using systemd services (`zeebull.service`, `inventory-resort.service`) specifying gunicorn/uvicorn processes run under safe service accounts (e.g. `User=basilabrahamsby`).
*   **Sync & Recovery Scripts**:
    *   `sync_db_52.ps1` / `get_backup_52.ps1`: Automated backup sync processes targeting primary server hosts.
    *   `restore_full_system.ps1` / `restore_local_52.ps1`: Complete systems restore scripts including database schemas and upload uploads folders (`uploads.tar.gz`).
    *   `recreate_db.py` / `clear_all_data_final.py`: Fast sandbox/database reset functions targeting sandbox environments while strictly shielding primary administrator credentials.

